th.dirname%28fileURLToPath%28import.meta.url%29%29%2C%20%27..%27%2C%20%27..%27%29%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Actual%20direct%20conversation%20captures.%20Appending%20these%20declarations%20never%0A%2F%2F%20rewrites%20an%20earlier%20live%20source%2C%20capture%2C%20timestamp%20or%20ledger%20mapping.%0Aexport%20const%20ASSERTION_POLICY_INSTRUCTION_SOURCES%20%3D%20Object.freeze%28%5B%0A%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27modern-javascript-parity-expectations-2026-10-16%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20key%3A%20%27modernJavaScriptParityRequest%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20title%3A%20%27Use%20newer%20JavaScript%20behavior%20and%20correct%20obsolete%20native%20expectations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20role%3A%20%27Explicit%20user%20resolution%20of%20the%20retained%20Rust%20versus%20JavaScript%20string%20length%20and%20array%20bounds%20expectation%20conflict%2C%20with%20the%20exact%20question%20and%20reply.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20ledgerCoverage%3A%20%5B%27I195-PARITY-MODERN-JAVASCRIPT-ARRAY-BEHAVIOR%27%2C%20%27I195-PARITY-OBSOLETE-NATIVE-EXPECTATIONS%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27compact-contributor-instructions-and-assertion-corrections-2026-10-16%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20key%3A%20%27compactContributorInstructionsRequest%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20title%3A%20%27Minimize%20contributor%20instructions%20and%20permit%20evidence%20based%20assertion%20corrections%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20role%3A%20%27Direct%20user%20request%20to%20shorten%20AGENTS.md%20and%20CLAUDE.md%20without%20losing%20obligations%20and%20to%20allow%20genuinely%20wrong%20assertions%20to%20be%20fixed.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20ledgerCoverage%3A%20%5B%27I195-CONTRIBUTOR-INSTRUCTIONS-CONCISE%27%2C%20%27I195-ASSERTION-EVIDENCE-BASED-CORRECTION%27%5D%2C%0A%20%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20id%3A%20%27version-bounded-assertions-2026-10-16%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20key%3A%20%27versionBoundedAssertionsRequest%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20title%3A%20%27Bound%20version%20dependent%20assertions%20to%20the%20actual%20active%20language%20or%20dependency%20version%27%2C